/* Relationships and family */Removed awkwardly positioned word to clarify that Kidman did not marry Cruise twice. (The use of the verb constructions "was married" and "has been married" essentially create a list of two things: Kidman 1) was married...and 2) has been married.

If the point is to stress that she has been married twice, a clearer construction would be something like:

Kidman has been married twice: to Tom Cruise from 1990 to 2001 and to country singer Keith Urban since 2006.
